@* FAQ *@
<section id="faq" class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-xl text-center mb-12 fade-in">
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p class="text-hc-dim">Discover quick and comprehensive answers to common questions about HealthyCron.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mx-auto max-w-xl fade-in">
            <!-- Accordion container -->
            <div class="bg-hc-surface rounded-2xl border border-hc-border px-8 py-3 shadow-sm">

                <div class="faq-item border-b border-dashed border-hc-border">
                    <button class="faq-trigger w-full py-4 flex items-center justify-between text-left gap-4" onclick="toggleFaqNew(this)">
                        <span class="text-base font-medium text-white">What is cron job monitoring?</span>
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-hc-dim flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-body overflow-hidden max-h-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
                        <p class="text-base text-hc-dim pb-4">Cron job monitoring tracks your scheduled tasks and alerts you when they fail, run late, or don't run at all. It ensures your background processes stay healthy and your team is immediately notified of any issues.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item border-b border-dashed border-hc-border">
                    <button class="faq-trigger w-full py-4 flex items-center justify-between text-left gap-4" onclick="toggleFaqNew(this)">
                        <span class="text-base font-medium text-white">How quickly do alerts get delivered?</span>
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-hc-dim flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-body overflow-hidden max-h-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
                        <p class="text-base text-hc-dim pb-4">Alerts are delivered within seconds of detecting an issue. We maintain a 99.99% alert delivery rate and support multiple channels including Slack, PagerDuty, Discord, and email.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item border-b border-dashed border-hc-border">
                    <button class="faq-trigger w-full py-4 flex items-center justify-between text-left gap-4" onclick="toggleFaqNew(this)">
                        <span class="text-base font-medium text-white">Can I monitor jobs in different environments?</span>
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-hc-dim flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-body overflow-hidden max-h-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
                        <p class="text-base text-hc-dim pb-4">Yes! HealthyCron supports environment tags so you can organize monitors by production, staging, development, or any custom environment you define. Each environment is tracked independently.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item border-b border-dashed border-hc-border">
                    <button class="faq-trigger w-full py-4 flex items-center justify-between text-left gap-4" onclick="toggleFaqNew(this)">
                        <span class="text-base font-medium text-white">Is there a free tier available?</span>
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-hc-dim flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-body overflow-hidden max-h-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
                        <p class="text-base text-hc-dim pb-4">Absolutely! Our free tier includes up to 5 monitors, email alerts, and 7-day log retention. Perfect for personal projects and small applications with no credit card required.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-trigger w-full py-4 flex items-center justify-between text-left gap-4" onclick="toggleFaqNew(this)">
                        <span class="text-base font-medium text-white">How do I integrate with my existing setup?</span>
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-hc-dim flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-body overflow-hidden max-h-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
                        <p class="text-base text-hc-dim pb-4">Integration takes just 2 minutes. Simply add a ping to your cron job using curl, wget, or our SDK. We provide copy-paste snippets for all major languages and platforms.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <p class="text-hc-dim mt-6 px-2 text-sm">
                Can't find what you're looking for?
                <a href="mailto:support@@healthycron.com" class="text-blue font-medium hover:underline ml-1">Contact our support team</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* CTA Section *@
<section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center fade-in">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Ready to Stop Missing Failures?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-hc-dim mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Join thousands of engineering teams who trust HealthyCron to keep their scheduled jobs running smoothly.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <a href="/signup" class="glow-btn px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-semibold text-white">Get Started Free</a>
            <button disabled class="px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-medium text-white bg-hc-surface border border-hc-border cursor-not-allowed opacity-60 transition-colors">Talk to Sales</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    function toggleFaqNew(btn) {
        var body = btn.nextElementSibling;
        var icon = btn.querySelector('svg');
        var isOpen = body.style.maxHeight && body.style.maxHeight !== '0px';

        // Close all others
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-body').forEach(function(b) {
            b.style.maxHeight = '0px';
        });
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-trigger svg').forEach(function(i) {
            i.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
        });

        if (!isOpen) {
            body.style.maxHeight = body.scrollHeight + 'px';
            icon.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';
        }
    }
</script>
